  "connectDemoBody": "Simulates a 2.0 L turbocharged four-cylinder engine through idle, acceleration, cruise and deceleration cycles, with signals that stay physically related to each other (engine speed drops on a gearshift while road speed keeps rising). Fault codes, VIN reads and fastMode batch queries all work in full.",
